# Copy to .env on each host. .env is untracked, so these never reach the repo.

# The address Caddy binds to — the host's VPN address, not a wildcard.
# `ip addr` on the host will show it. Unset means loopback only, which makes
# the app unreachable from the VPN rather than exposing it on every interface.
BIND_ADDR=10.0.0.1
